Write Flow
AXI AW/W
 → axi_write_fsm
 → axi_cmd_pack
 → FIFO
 → apb_master_fsm
 → APB slave
 → rsp_valid
 → response_gen
 → write_done
 → axi_write_fsm
 → AXI B channel

Read Flow
AXI AR
 → axi_read_fsm
 → axi_cmd_pack
 → FIFO
 → apb_master_fsm
 → APB slave
 → rsp_valid + rsp_rdata
 → response_gen
 → read_valid + read_data
 → axi_read_fsm
 → AXI R channel

***************************************************************************************
| Concern             | Owner        |
| ------------------- | ------------ |
| AXI timing          | AXI FSMs     |
| AXI fragmentation   | cmd_pack     |
| Ordering            | FIFO         |
| APB timing          | APB FSM      |
| Address decode      | Decoder      |
| Response formatting | response_gen |
| System policy       | Top          |
**************************************************************************************

